- Improved terminal output normalization to account for collapsed text in progress frames.
- Added a new function to detect if terminal output has collapsed due to repeated lines.
- Optimized inline line compression to handle oversized single-line repeated patterns without full regex scanning.
- Updated shell tool guidance on output compression to clarify usage and recommendations.
- Enhanced parameter schema documentation for compress_output to emphasize user defaults.
- Added tests to ensure correct behavior for ANSI-decorated repeated lines and oversized single-line patterns.

